# A CMake package config template is a source file, not one of the generated `.in` artefacts the
# pattern above is aimed at. Without this, `cmake/KukiEngineConfig.cmake.in` is silently left out
# of the repository and a fresh clone cannot configure a shared build at all.
!*.cmake.in
